cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MD.Scribe in research, teaching or a published deployment, cite it as below."
title: MD.Scribe
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted PHP 8.5 Markdown documentation platform: a CommonMark and GFM viewer with
  full-text search, a command palette, Mermaid diagrams and KaTeX math, plus an admin
  panel with editor, backups, audit trail and a verified self-updater. No database, no
  framework, no build step on the server and no CDN dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Deynekin
    given-names: Mikhail
    alias: paulmann
version: 3.6.1
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/paulmann/MD.Scribe"
keywords:
  - markdown
  - documentation
  - php
  - self-hosted
  - admin-panel
  - commonmark
  - gfm
